WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.360
At the NATO Summit in June, virtually all NATO

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:05.500
members formally committed to increase defense

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.340
spending, at my request, from 2 percent to 5

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:13.440
percent of GDP, making our alliance far stronger and

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:17.379
more powerful than it was ever before.

00:00:17.379 --> 00:00:20.540
In May, I traveled to the Middle East to visit my

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:23.020
friends and rebuild our partnerships in the Gulf

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:25.959
and those valued relationships with Saudi

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:30.400
Arabia, Qatar, and the UAE, and other countries

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:34.360
are now, I believe, closer than ever before.

